{'symbol': 'JPM', 'date': '2023-06-20 16:41:00', 'title': 'JPMORGAN CHASE TO HOST SECOND-QUARTER 2023 EARNINGS CALL', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AS PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED, JPMORGAN CHASE & CO. (NYSE: JPM) (“JPMORGAN CHASE” OR THE “FIRM”) WILL HOST A CONFERENCE CALL TO REVIEW SECOND-QUARTER 2023 FINANCIAL RESULTS ON FRIDAY, JULY 14, 2023 AT 8:30 A.M. (EDT). THE RESULTS ARE SCHEDULED TO BE RELEASED AT APPROXIMATELY 7:00 A.M. (EDT). THE LIVE AUDIO WEBCAST AND PRESENTATION SLIDES WILL BE AVAILABLE ON WWW.JPMORGANCHASE.COM UNDER INVESTOR RELATIONS, EVENTS & PRESENTATIONS. JPMORGAN CHASE WILL NOTIFY THE PUBLIC.'}